NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ANNA OS Lite is a training simulator. It is not a medical device, it is not
clinical decision support, and it must not be used to guide the care of a real
patient. It does not diagnose, it does not measure anything about a real person,
and it will not teach you first aid.

Nothing in this software is a substitute for training delivered by a qualified
instructor, or for the resuscitation guidelines that apply where you are.

